concise\\\" is not measurable, and the documented 150-word limit (which product.yaml says the preview view also enforces) is not asserted.\\n**After (description):** The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the preview view.\\n**After (steps):**\\n```yaml\\n- given:\\n    - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n- when:\\n    - 'the Calculator User requests the \\\"preview\\\" view'\\n- then:\\n    - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\nNo ACs are added, merged or removed.\\n\\nResulting measurability: 3/3 = 100% of ACs include a measurable criterion (`at most 150 words`), which passes the 50% threshold.\\n\\n## Complete Fixed Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n```yaml\\n- id: 001-brief\\n  description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the brief view.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given:\\n        - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - 'the Calculator User requests the \\\"brief\\\" view'\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n\\n- id: 002-overview\\n  description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the overview view.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given:\\n        - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - 'the Calculator User requests the \\\"overview\\\" view'\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n\\n- id: 003-preview\\n  description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the preview view.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given:\\n        - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - 'the Calculator User requests the \\\"preview\\\" view'\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\n## Implementation note (not an AC change)\\nWhen automating